[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496047431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628#issuecomment-2496047431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99628","id":2496047431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UxqlH","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T15:01:32Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T15:01:32Z","body":"I'm not... necessarily against this but it would be a whole lot less code to just draw what the Marker2D node draws, wouldn't it? This feels over-engineered. Even the additional note in the docs is over-engineered.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496047431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496064251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628#issuecomment-2496064251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99628","id":2496064251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Uxur7","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T15:28:17Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T16:18:40Z","body":"The simplest way will be just to add property to show/hide this reference cross. But this reference cross will stay hardcoded (which is not good IMO) and this property will be present in release builds (please correct me if there is possibility to make editor-only properties).\r\n\r\nI'm not saying that current PR is the best that could be done, it's just possible option. First of all this is just concept of how it may be changed to gather any feedback. Most likely this PR will be stalled (2 issues in ~7 years - not high-priority problem at all) and I'll close it later.\r\n\r\nUpd: I've added [possible alternatives](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11225#issuecomment-2496092006) into feature proposal","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496064251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496152691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628#issuecomment-2496152691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99628","id":2496152691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UyERz","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T18:16:19Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T18:16:19Z","body":"> and this property will be present in release builds (please correct me if there is possibility to make editor-only properties).\r\n\r\nThere are precedents. For example:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c45ace151f25de2ca54fe7a46b6f077be32ba6f/scene/main/scene_tree.h#L140-L144\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c45ace151f25de2ca54fe7a46b6f077be32ba6f/scene/main/scene_tree.h#L350-L368\r\n\r\nNotice how in every other build other than debug the getters always return `false` (which the compiler likely optimises out). Yeah, the property **should** still be bound, but its getter and setters can be coded to do nothing.\r\n\r\nI do find that reusing Marker2D for this is kind of clever but my personal concern still stands.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496152691/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496153362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628#issuecomment-2496153362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99628","id":2496153362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UyEcS","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T18:18:38Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T18:18:38Z","body":"Also, wait. Wouldn't `Node.is_part_of_edited_scene()` also solve the original issue?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496153362/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1